    narr:narration """The trajectory of instrument verification centers on anchoring systems to empirical baselines, notably through [Kestrelwood spectrograph calibration](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1) set at 88.4 MHz. Verification routines ensure that [calibration holds across observing bands](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2) when checked against historical baselines, aligning with broader documentation that [instrument calibration is validated against empirical reference plates](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerifiedAgainstReferenceStandards).""" ;
